[
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "视频通话接通了，我的男朋友微笑着。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0,
    "sfx_plan": [
      {
        "id": "sfx_video_connect",
        "action": "generate",
        "purpose": "semantic_cue",
        "sound_class": "视频通话接通提示",
        "prompt": "短促清晰的视频通话接通电子提示音，近距离，干净利落地收尾",
        "anchor": "dialogue_start",
        "offset_ms": 0,
        "duration_seconds": 0.8,
        "mix_preset": "cue_before_dialogue",
        "required": false
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "布罗迪",
    "text_content": "首先，我爱你，我想你，我等不及你回家了。",
    "emotion": "happy",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "阿莉娅",
    "text_content": "我也爱你，我也等不及了！",
    "emotion": "excited",
    "intensity": "较强",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "我盯着电脑屏幕，",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "阿莉娅",
    "text_content": "你在哪儿？",
    "emotion": "confusion",
    "intensity": "稍弱",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "布罗迪",
    "text_content": "我在阁楼里，我把弓箭器材放上去的时候，发现了个挺酷的东西。",
    "emotion": "happy",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "他刚在休斯敦一个安静的社区买了一栋老房子，我希望那里有一天能成为我们的社区。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "我们交往三年了，我猜他可能会在今年春天我大学毕业之后求婚。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "布罗迪",
    "text_content": "看看这个。",
    "emotion": "excited",
    "intensity": "稍弱",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "他把一个落满灰尘的箱子拖到吊灯下面，好让我看清上面的刻纹。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "看起来像是阿拉伯文。他打开箱子，取出一个三角形护身符，银质的，上面有同样的标记。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "接着是一个极小的推拉盒，里面装着碎纸片、木屑，还有一些辨认不出的块状物。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "布罗迪",
    "text_content": "闻起来像……茉莉花？",
    "emotion": "surprised",
    "intensity": "稍弱",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "他凑近嗅了嗅。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "下一个物件是个束口袋。他打开袋子，把里面的东西倒在掌心里。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "布罗迪",
    "text_content": "呃。脚趾甲？搞什么鬼……",
    "emotion": "disgusted",
    "intensity": "较强",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "箱子里最后两样东西是一本破旧的《古兰经》和一盒玻璃球。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "阿莉娅",
    "text_content": "装饰品？",
    "emotion": "confusion",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "布罗迪",
    "text_content": "不是。没有挂钩或绳子的地方。有三个透明的，还有这个。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "他举起来给我看，是烟熏黄的颜色。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "我发誓那球在他掌心里动了一下。它摔到地上，碎了。",
    "emotion": "fear",
    "intensity": "微弱",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0,
    "sfx_plan": [
      {
        "id": "sfx_glass_break",
        "action": "generate",
        "purpose": "foreground_action",
        "sound_class": "玻璃球掉落碎裂",
        "prompt": "玻璃球从手中滑落，掉在硬质地面上发出清脆的破碎声，碎片四溅，余响短暂迅速收尾",
        "anchor": "dialogue_end",
        "offset_ms": 0,
        "duration_seconds": 1.5,
        "mix_preset": "transition",
        "required": false
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "有什么东西闪过，像火焰一样。布罗迪骂了一句。",
    "emotion": "fear",
    "intensity": "微弱",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "阿莉娅",
    "text_content": "那是什么？",
    "emotion": "surprised",
    "intensity": "较强",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "布罗迪",
    "text_content": "我……我不知道。",
    "emotion": "fear",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "他盯着我视线之外的地方。他歪着头，好像在听什么。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "布罗迪",
    "text_content": "布罗迪，",
    "emotion": "confusion",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "布罗迪",
    "text_content": "唐娜特。",
    "emotion": "confusion",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "阿莉娅",
    "text_content": "什么？",
    "emotion": "surprised",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "唐娜特是他母亲的名字。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "布罗迪茫然地看着屏幕。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "布罗迪",
    "text_content": "我得挂了。",
    "emotion": "fear",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "没再多说一个字，他结束了Skype通话。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0,
    "sfx_plan": [
      {
        "id": "sfx_skype_hangup",
        "action": "generate",
        "purpose": "semantic_cue",
        "sound_class": "视频通话挂断提示音",
        "prompt": "短促清晰的视频通话挂断提示音，带有一点软件音效的电子质感，干净收尾",
        "anchor": "dialogue_end",
        "offset_ms": 0,
        "duration_seconds": 0.8,
        "mix_preset": "transition",
        "required": false
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "我试图打回去，他没接。那晚他也没接。终于，第二天早上，他接了。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0.5
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "布罗迪",
    "text_content": "我现在有点忙。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "阿莉娅",
    "text_content": "你还好吗？",
    "emotion": "empathy",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "布罗迪",
    "text_content": "嗯。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "稍弱",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "他说，然后挂断了。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0,
    "sfx_plan": [
      {
        "id": "sfx_phone_hangup",
        "action": "generate",
        "purpose": "semantic_cue",
        "sound_class": "电话挂断提示音",
        "prompt": "短促的座机电话挂断咔嗒声，清脆利落，近处收尾",
        "anchor": "dialogue_end",
        "offset_ms": 0,
        "duration_seconds": 0.6,
        "mix_preset": "transition",
        "required": false
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "接下来一整天，我都没有他的消息，于是我打电话给他姐姐，让她去看看他。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "一小时后她回了电话。她的声音很谨慎：",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "姐姐",
    "text_content": "嗯，阿莉娅。我看见他了。他看起来有点糟。听着……你们吵架了吗？",
    "emotion": "empathy",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "阿莉娅",
    "text_content": "什么？没有！",
    "emotion": "surprised",
    "intensity": "较强",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "姐姐",
    "text_content": "我告诉他你在担心他，他就那么看着我。",
    "emotion": "confusion",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "阿莉娅",
    "text_content": "他昨天还好好的。我们还在计划圣诞假期的安排。",
    "emotion": "confusion",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "又是一阵犹豫。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 1.0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "姐姐",
    "text_content": "他表现得……几乎像磕了药。我从不知道布罗迪会——",
    "emotion": "fear",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "阿莉娅",
    "text_content": "他不会。从来不。",
    "emotion": "angry",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "姐姐",
    "text_content": "好吧，只是……给他一两天时间。也许他真的在忙什么事。有消息我会告诉你的。",
    "emotion": "empathy",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "但她没有。我也没有。他不接我电话，也不回短信。",
    "emotion": "fear",
    "intensity": "微弱",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "这太不像布罗迪了。我胃里翻江倒海，真不知道我怎么熬过期末考试的。",
    "emotion": "fear",
    "intensity": "微弱",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "我想到了他找到的那些奇怪的东西。一定和那有关。",
    "emotion": "fear",
    "intensity": "微弱",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "我的祖母是孟加拉裔，穆斯林。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "我父亲不信仰任何宗教，但我上学期修了一门伊斯兰传统的课程。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "我很喜欢那位教授，在飞回家前的那个早上，我顺道去了她的办公室。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "教授",
    "text_content": "阿莉娅！真是个惊喜。",
    "emotion": "happy",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "当我告诉她布罗迪的发现和那通诡异的视频通话时，她的笑容消失了。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "她走到书架前，拿起一本书。翻了几页，她停下来递给我。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "教授",
    "text_content": "那些刻纹和护身符，是不是长这样？",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "阿莉娅",
    "text_content": "是的。这是什么？",
    "emotion": "confusion",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "教授",
    "text_content": "我们课上没有多讲，但《古兰经》认为安拉有三种有智识的造物：天使、人类和精灵。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "教授",
    "text_content": "你描述的那些物件，是魔法师用来控制和役使精灵的。有时他们会把这些生物困在玻璃球里。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "我笑了。",
    "emotion": "humour",
    "intensity": "稍弱",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "阿莉娅",
    "text_content": "精灵？你是说神灯精灵？",
    "emotion": "humour",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "教授",
    "text_content": "你描述的那些是邪恶的魔法。你说他重复了他母亲的名字？",
    "emotion": "fear",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "教授",
    "text_content": "传说中，魔法师需要三样东西才能跟恶魔谈论你。一个名字、你母亲的名字，和一份痕迹。头发、指甲屑……",
    "emotion": "fear",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0.5
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "阿莉娅",
    "text_content": "您不会真的相信有精灵吧？",
    "emotion": "surprised",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "她看了我很久，然后说：",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 1.0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "教授",
    "text_content": "我会发一封邮件给你，里面有一些经文，可以抵御精灵附身。等你见到布罗迪，不妨试试。还有，阿莉娅……小心点。",
    "emotion": "empathy",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "我对她的警告一笑置之，但那天下午敲响布罗迪家门时，我的心沉甸甸的。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "他敲到第三下才开门。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "他的样子让我震惊。他看起来很疲惫，胡子拉碴。",
    "emotion": "fear",
    "intensity": "微弱",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "他看着我，仿佛我是个陌生人。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "阿莉娅",
    "text_content": "布罗迪？怎么回事？",
    "emotion": "surprised",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "他身后的走廊里有什么东西一闪而过，像是相机闪光灯的余晖。",
    "emotion": "fear",
    "intensity": "微弱",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "我发誓我瞬间看见了一个火焰凝成的女人。",
    "emotion": "fear",
    "intensity": "微弱",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "他回头看了一眼，又转向我。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "布罗迪",
    "text_content": "你该走了。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "role_name": "旁白",
    "text_content": "他当着我的面关上了门。",
    "emotion": "coldness",
    "intensity": "中等",
    "clone_mode": "ultimate",
    "delivery_profile": "baseline",
    "voxcpm_nonverbal_tags": [],
    "needs_review": false,
    "break_duration": 0,
